      "id": "claim_62228a8589db427992f2f0bef47b2a17",
      "statement": "The GitHub content-publishing and content-replication roles grant identity and trust only: the shared-iam module's content-publishing.tf references no bucket, KMS key, or region, so a publisher role is assumable but holds no content access until a separate regional Terraform change attaches S3/KMS permissions.",
