      "id": "claim_fcd0296bd2314fbd84a609ab226a34fb",
      "statement": "The shared-iam module's outputs separate a fixed-shape roles map of core operational identities from a configuration-dependent content_publisher_roles map keyed by source (name, ARN, repository, branch, trust subject) and a distinct content_replication_role, and the account root re-exports these alongside github_actions_oidc_provider_arn so the identity contract stays stable regardless of how many publisher sources or OIDC providers are configured.",
