        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/cmd/root.go#L100-L139",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3cb7b8686528aaed13e2a5d18f969e705bf988751a5a7221e77ae5d3c83a5f54:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7d5dff51c17f4217a1329802709c5d62",
      "statement": "The device-authorization flow (acquireDeviceToken in internal/auth/device.go) is a distinct implementation from the PKCE browser flow: it is selected by explicit --use-device-code=true, else ROSA_BOUNDARY_OIDC_USE_DEVICE_CODE, else the profile's saved oidc_use_device_code, else default false; it validates the provider's device-authorization response (expiry bounds, verification URI scheme/host, user-code length, absence of control characters, and that the URI does not embed the device code) before displaying it, and bounds polling to the provider's expires_in window while handling authorization_pending, slow_down, access_denied, and expired_token.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/auth/device.go#L40-L151",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5db611cd67225f26288c982c5a26502833b6fd80d48028185fbe734fd0a6c7e3:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/config/config_test.go#L12-L42",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5fd5f3c7d98df156d1e1e29134c4e9e8dd26425ebf585922afbe60e4981ee5a4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dd797eeb2e3a47f4a76941f4e36fc778",
      "statement": "The PKCE browser-callback flow (acquireBrowserToken delegating to internal/auth/callback.go) runs a local callback HTTP server bound to 127.0.0.1:8400 that rejects a missing authorization code or a state mismatch (treated as possible CSRF) and sanitizes any provider-supplied error/error_description by stripping ASCII control characters and capping length before echoing them into the browser response, guarding against injection from an untrusted redirect.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/auth/callback.go#L28-L113",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7563418ade3b5bf3ce8af56f2385c2d1093b2811662cd524d53f3be057fde468:"
        },
        {
